  "note": "New subpath ./purchase/wallet-bridge with createPurchaseWalletBridge({walletFactory}). The callback runs once at construction and returns {rpcUrl, network, journal, sourceCapability, requestWallet}; the bridge builds the existing storage-anchor wallet bridge from exactly those five values and returns a frozen {anchor, resume, verifyReceipt} that passes each argument and result through. It refuses with DemosSr2BridgeError wallet-required for a missing factory, a result without requestWallet, or a wallet factory that returns no packaged wallet. It holds no key and writes nothing itself. The manifest pin in scripts/check-hold.mjs gains the new export, re-pinned with pin-delta.mjs; the client entry joins requiredExports in scripts/release-policy.json with its manifest digest."
